BT 1 0 0 1 0 58.2 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13.5 TL (SuppleCare is a web application that helps people organize their daily supplement routines and related wellness) Tj T* (habits. Users can build a schedule, mark doses as taken, receive reminders, plan meals for the week, record daily) Tj T* (health check-ins, and review adherence over time. The interface supports English and Khmer. A separate) Tj T* (administrator area manages user accounts, the supplement catalog, spacing rules, starter meal plans, and) Tj T* (administrator accounts.) Tj T* ET
